    },
    {
      "node_id": "recap_kiosk_help",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "At the kiosk, you helped Mama Achieng' find her way. Patience is a kind of courage. She won't forget it.",
      "text_sw": null,
      "gloss": null,
      "expression": null,
      "choices": null,
      "next": "end_closing"
    },
    {
      "node_id": "recap_kiosk_tease",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "At the kiosk, you teased Mama Achieng' — and she rose to the challenge. Sometimes a push is what people need. She'll remember that too.",
      "text_sw": null,
      "gloss": null,
      "expression": null,
      "choices": null,
      "next": "end_closing"
    },
    {
      "node_id": "end_closing",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "M-Pesa is live. The election is a year away. The estate is humming with life, laughter, and a hundred small arguments that don't mean much yet.",
      "text_sw": null,
      "gloss": null,
      "expression": null,
      "choices": null,
